        become /ri sum /ri u64:1.
    ::.

    : 6. Emit `Dc 2192` StageL 3 module header (`ns` + original `use`s + synthetic aliased `use`s) + `bodyBuf` + `Dc 2193`.
    emitShort /out u32:2192.
    if field /pm u32:3
        do
            emitShort /out u32:2194.
            emitFilePath /out field /pm u32:4.
        ::
        emitShort /out u32:316.

    hold u64/ui u64:0.
    while lt /ui len /uses do
        be useItem/first at /uses /ui.
        be l/u8/gKey field /first u32:1.
        emitShort /out u32:2195.
        emitFilePath /out field /first u32:0.
        hold b/sameGroup true.
        while and lt /ui len /uses /sameGroup do
            be useItem/cur at /uses /ui.
            if eq field /cur u32:1 /gKey
                do
                    emitShort /out u32:2197.
                    emitSymTarget /out field /cur u32:2.
                    if eq len field /cur u32:3 u64:0
                        emitShort /out u32:316
                        emitIdent /out field /cur u32:3.
                    become /ui sum /ui u64:1.
                ::
                become /sameGroup false.
        ::.
        emitShort /out u32:2196.
    ::.

    be l/synthImport/frozenSynths bufFrozen /synths.
    foreach synthImport/si /frozenSynths do
        emitShort /out u32:2195.
        emitFilePath /out field /si u32:3.
        emitShort /out u32:2197.
        emitIdent /out field /si u32:4.
        emitIdent /out field /si u32:2.
        emitShort /out u32:2196.
    ::.

    bufGainAll /out bufFrozen /bodyBuf.
    emitShort /out u32:2193.

: Parses a multi-module Token-Dc stream containing bundled Stage 1 (`Dc 2192`) and StageR 3 (`Dc 2221`) modules.
: @dc l8589983113
v/l/parsedMod/parseAllModules l/dcVal/tokens
    hold u64/cur skipComments /tokens u64:0.
    if ge /cur len /tokens fault nop.
    be buf/parsedMod/mods bufNew parsedMod u64:4.
    while lt /cur len /tokens do
        be u32/sid dcShortId at /tokens /cur.
        if eq /sid u32:2192
            do
                be tup: parsedMod u64 ::/mr parseStage1Module /tokens /cur.
                bufGain /mods field /mr u32:0.
                become /cur skipComments /tokens field /mr u32:1.
            ::
            if eq /sid u32:2221
                do
                    be tup: parsedMod u64 ::/mr parseStageRModule /tokens /cur.
                    bufGain /mods field /mr u32:0.
                    become /cur skipComments /tokens field /mr u32:1.
                ::
                fault.
    ::.
    bufFrozen /mods.

: Lowers a StageR 3 Token-Dc stream (`l/dcVal`, optionally preceded by bundled Stage 1 dependency modules)
: into a canonical StageL 3 Token-Dc stream (`l/dcVal`).
: @dc l8589983114
v/l/dcVal/stager3ToStagel3Tokens l/dcVal/tokens
    be l/parsedMod/mods parseAllModules /tokens.
    hold b/anyStageR false.
    foreach parsedMod/pm /mods do
        if field /pm u32:0 become /anyStageR true nop.
    ::.
    if not /anyStageR fault nop.

    be tup: compEnv l/modScope ::/built buildCompEnv /mods.
    be compEnv/env field /built u32:0.
    be l/modScope/scopes field /built u32:1.

    be buf/dcVal/out bufNew dcVal len /tokens.
    hold u64/mi u64:0.
    while lt /mi len /mods do
        be parsedMod/pm at /mods /mi.
        if field /pm u32:0
            lowerStageRModule /out /env at /scopes /mi /pm
            bufGainAll /out slice /tokens field /pm u32:1 field /pm u32:2.
        become /mi sum /mi u64:1.
    ::.
    bufFrozen /out.

: Public document transformation (`f1681`, `StageR3ToStageL3`) lowering a DcTF-encoded
: StageR 3 Token-Dc stream into a DcTF-encoded StageL 3 Token-Dc stream.
pub dc/f1681 v/l/u8/stager3ToStagel3 l/u8/input
    test
        in b"/xf4/x90/xa2/xad/xf4/x90/x84/xbc/xf4/x90/xa2/x9b/xf4/x90/x88/x86/xf4/x90/x84/xbc/xf8/x88/xa0/x96/x91/xf4/x90/x84/x8e/x66/xf4/x90/x84/x8f/xf4/x90/xa6/x97/xf4/x90/xa2/x9c/xf4/x90/xa2/xae"
        out b"/xf4/x90/xa2/x90/xf4/x90/x84/xbc/xf4/x90/xa2/x9b/xf4/x90/x88/x86/xf4/x90/x84/xbc/xf8/x88/xa0/x96/x91/xf4/x90/x84/x8e/x66/xf4/x90/x84/x8f/xf4/x90/xa6/x97/xf4/x90/xa2/x9c/xf4/x90/xa2/x91".
    be tup: b l/dcVal ::/dec decodeDcStream /input.
    if not field /dec u32:0
        fault
        encodeDcStream stager3ToStagel3Tokens field /dec u32:1.
